.TH "PROCESSINGINSTRUCTION.PROCESSINGINSTRUCTION" "3JS" "August 13, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
ProcessingInstruction.ProcessingInstruction \- ProcessingInstruction:
ProcessingInstruction() constructor
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]ProcessingInstruction()\f[B]\f[R] constructor creates a
new \f[CR]ProcessingInstruction\f[R] object instance.
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
new ProcessingInstruction(target, data)
.EE
.SS Parameters
.TP
\f[B]target\f[R]
A string representing the type of event.
.TP
\f[B]data\f[R]
A string containing any information the processing instruction should
carry, after the target.
The data is up to you, but it can\(cqt contain \f[CR]?>\f[R], since that
closes the processing instruction.
.SS Return value
Processing instructions are, as the name suggests, are instructions
about how to process the document.
They can include stylesheets for XML documents, placeholders for HTML
documents, or other processing instructions.
.PP
A new \f[CR]ProcessingInstruction\f[R] object, if used internally by the
browser.
.PP
Developers cannot use the \f[CR]ProcessingInstruction()\f[R] constructor
directly to create a new \f[CR]ProcessingInstruction\f[R] instance, and
must use the \f[CR]document.createProcessingInstruction()\f[R] method
instead.
Attempting to use the \f[CR]ProcessingInstruction()\f[R] constructor
directly results in an \(lqillegal constructor\(rq error.
.SS Exceptions
.TP
\f[B]InvalidCharacterError\f[R] \f[B]DOMException\f[R]
Thrown if either of the following are true:
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
The \f[CR]target\f[R] value is not a valid \c
.UR https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#dt-name
XML name
.UE \c
; for example, it starts with a number, hyphen, or period, or contains
characters other than alphanumeric characters, underscores, hyphens, or
periods.
.IP \(bu 2
The \f[I]closing processing instruction sequence\f[R] (\f[CR]?>\f[R]) is
part of the \f[CR]data\f[R] value.
.RE
.TP
\f[B]TypeError\f[R]
Thrown with the message \f[CR]\(dqIllegal constructor\(dq\f[R] when used
directly.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
\f[B]const\f[R] doc = \f[B]new\f[R] DOMParser().parseFromString(\(dq<foo />\(dq, \(dqapplication/xml\(dq);
\f[B]const\f[R] pi = doc.createProcessingInstruction(
  \(dqxml\-stylesheet\(dq,
  \(aqhref=\(dqmycss.css\(dq\(aq,
);
.EE
